ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids in Humphreys County has 75 years on record, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 175% of normal in April to May but just 31% in November to December. This year started dry, with February to March at 36% of normal in 2026, and the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 on grid 19069 sits at 54.6.</p>"}
